Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:15.66,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:15.66,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}诺斯科娃 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 布尔特 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,comes out, breaks you early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一上来就破了你的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but you obviously figured something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你显然找到了办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the adjustment you made?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你做了什么调整
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,It was just probably the mental state.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概就是心态吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, it's never easy to start a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局从来都不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to be a break down immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,一上来就被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and then have to get back into the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后还得把自己拉回比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Katie, she's a great player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,凯蒂是很好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I knew it was going to be tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道这场会难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,especially at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是开头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I had to find my rhythm and, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我得先找到节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,try to find my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,找回自己的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, we've been waiting just too many weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们已经等了太多个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to say this to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能当面说这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Cincinnati, the 2026 Wimbledon champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提 有请温网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:42.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Linda Noskova.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,琳达·诺斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So, we all want to know the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都想知道同一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,How much did you practice the dancing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,夺冠之后那支舞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:54.16,EN,,0,0,0,,had to do after you won the title?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你练了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't think that you would ask me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,没想到你会问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:01:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,this, but I did not practice once,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:01:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个 但我一次都没练过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,so it was probably, you know, visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以估计看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that neither did Jannik.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜扬尼克也没练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So we had about the same experience
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我俩的体验差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was fun you know it was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但挺好玩的 挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,A lot of people were preparing me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多人提前给我打预防针
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,for this moment of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,说晚上会有这一出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not looking forward for it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我本来一点都不期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但真跳起来挺开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:20.48,EN,,0,0,0,,All right. I'm going to accuse you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我要指控你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Last time you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and I talked maybe it was in Indian Wells
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概是在印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was congratulating you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,on the season you're having and you said I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季打得好 而你说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,don't feel like I've done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我什么都没做成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You don't celebrate easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不太会庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on the great season you're having.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季这么出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I still don't know how to celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我到现在还是不知道怎么庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,说老实话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I still have not probably 100% realized what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,过去这几周发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,happened in the last couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我大概还没完全消化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, one would have thought I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,按说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,would gained such confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我应该因此获得很大的信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切还是老样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,It's still tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,The court is still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,球场还是那个球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,everything is, you know, nothing changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都没变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I had to get back and start, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我得回来 重新开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,all over again like it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,从头再来 像什么都没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, one thing that's never changed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一件事从来没变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,is the fact that Cincinnati loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是辛辛那提爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Show some love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:15.66,EN,,0,0,0,,for Grand Slam champion Linda Noskova.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,送给大满贯冠军诺斯科娃
